# Google OAuth — get your Client ID from https://console.cloud.google.com
# 1. Create a project → APIs & Services → Credentials → Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 2. Application type: Web application
# 3. Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
# 4. Paste the Client ID below (it ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
